## 🔴 BLOCKING — Two deploy gates before Direction F + Batch 22 work in staging/prod

1. **APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY** must be present in .env.staging + .env.prod.
   Generate per env: `openssl rand -base64 32 | tr -d '\n' | head -c 44`.
   Add to CREDENTIALS.md (gitignored). Komodo Stack restart to pick up the
   new env var. Without this, every checkout AND every webhook throws at
   decrypt time. (Carried from Batch 21a.)

2. **Both EcommerceOrder migrations** must run before deploy. Apply via:
   `pnpm --filter @orqafy/db exec prisma migrate deploy` on each env.
   - 20260521194500_add_tenant_id_to_ecommerce_orders (3-stage backfill — Batch 21c)
   - 20260529014600_add_webhook_processed_at_to_ecommerce_orders (additive — Batch 22)
   Full apply procedure + rollback notes in docs/deployment-direction-f.md.

